{"segs": ["PA_dt_1.1:2.1"], "en": "Inclusion and non-inclusion;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_dt_1.1:3.1"], "en": "by means of what is included, what is not included.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
